<view class="page center"><image class="bird" src="/assets/bird.webp" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="title">{{book.status === 'failed' ? '有一页需要再试一次' : '叽咕正在画下这个小瞬间…'}}</view><view class="sub">{{book.title}}</view><view class="progress"><progress percent="{{percent}}" stroke-width="4" activeColor="#becdb3" backgroundColor="#eee8e0"/><view class="small">{{book.status === 'failed' ? '已收好 ' + done + ' 页 / 共 ' + book.count + ' 页' : '正在画第 ' + running + ' 页 / 共 ' + book.count + ' 页'}}</view></view><view class="notice">可以先去忙，小书会继续画。<br/>下次从「我的小书」回来就能找到。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{book.status === 'failed'}}" class="primary" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">恢复未完成的页面</button><button wx:if="{{done > 0}}" class="text-button" bindtap="read">先看看已经画好的</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="shelf">回到我的小书</button><button class="text-button" open-type="contact">需要帮助</button></view>